  "description": "The seagulls that suddenly hit a village one day.  \nThe protagonist, Han-cheon, who fled the village to find a way to live after losing his mother to a sea ghoul,  \nIt is learned that the mother was not actually killed by the haegui, but was kidnapped for food.  \nHan-cheon goes on a dangerous journey to save his mother...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=762786), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=5786969)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/BOY/haigui/list?title_no=1818)",
